# jemdoc: menu{./MENU}{index.html}{welcome}
== Welcome!
I am a Ph.D student (under the supervision of [http://alpage.inria.fr/~sagot/ Benoît Sagot]), in the [https://team.inria.fr/almanach/fr/ ALMAnaCH team] in [https://www.inria.fr/centre/paris Inria Paris]. I used to be a software engineer.

Apart from research and programming, I am interested in outreach (mostly towards girls), making science understandable, and delicious food.

Research topics:
- using neural networks for historical linguistics, 
- improving low resource machine translation
- and sometimes, neural network interpretability

~~~

*Contact*: You can reach me at /myfirstname dot mylastname at inria dot fr/, on [https://twitter.com/clefourrier Twitter], or [https://www.linkedin.com/in/clefourrier/ LinkedIn]. 

== About this site
This site is deliberately static and lightweight, for ecology, accessibility, and [https://jeffhuang.com/designed_to_last/ this] ([https://framablog.org/2020/08/24/pour-une-page-web-qui-dure-10-ans French version]).

